440
00:17:38,968 --> 00:17:39,968
- It was my father's friendship

441
00:17:39,968 --> 00:17:41,634
 for you that brought me here.

442
00:17:41,634 --> 00:17:42,868
 - Did anyone see you?

443
00:17:42,868 --> 00:17:46,101
- [Tom] Gotta go, gotta
go, gotta go, gotta...

